Package: rts2-python
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: rts2-db
Description: Remote Telescope System 2 - Python client scripting support
 RTS2 (Remote Telescope System, 2nd version) is a distributed control
 system for robotic astronomical observatories.
 .
 This package contains the rts2 Python module RTS2's "exe" observation
 scripts import: rts2.scriptcomm, the library they use to talk to the
 running system (device values, state, exposures, image handling, ...),
 rts2.flats, the sky-flat engine that a site's per-camera flat
 scripts configure and drive, and rts2.grb_query, which reads GRB details
 for a target out of the RTS2 database. Site-independent scripts are installed to
 /usr/share/rts2/scripts, with /etc/rts2/scripts kept as a symlink to
 it; scripts specific to one observatory live in a separate
 rts2-python-SITE package (see rts2-python-sbt). rts2-base's script-path resolution (see [scriptexec]
 script_path in rts2.ini, defaulting to /etc/rts2/scripts) finds
 anything there by bare filename, e.g. "exe guideccd.py", without every
 target/camera needing a full path. Pure Python, no compiled
 extensions; the same setup.py this package builds from is also
 directly pip-installable.

Package: rts2-python-sbt
Architecture: all
Depends: rts2-python, ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Remote Telescope System 2 - observation scripts for SBT
 RTS2 (Remote Telescope System, 2nd version) is a distributed control
 system for robotic astronomical observatories.
 .
 Observation scripts specific to the Small Binocular Telescope: the C3
 pulse-guiding script, per-camera sky-flat configurations for C1-C3
 driving rts2.flats, the filter-synchronized multi-camera sequencer,
 the adaptive and plain multi-band scripts, and an idle-time sky
 survey. Installed to /usr/share/rts2/scripts, where rts2-base's
 script-path resolution ([scriptexec] script_path in rts2.ini,
 defaulting to /etc/rts2/scripts) finds them by bare filename - so a
 target's script can read "exe guideccd.py" with no absolute path.
 .
 Other observatories should ship their own rts2-python-SITE package
 rather than adding scripts here.
